Package: literatureradar
Title: Automated PubMed Journal Monitoring
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Literature", "Radar", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "noreply@example.org")
Description: Retrieve PubMed records by journal and PubMed creation date, keep
    per-journal cursors, and publish immutable retrieval reports.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
